@NovaKnowledge.Ingestion.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5004

### Upload a document (multipart/form-data)
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Ingestion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingest/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-hr-policy.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./sample-hr-policy.txt
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenantId"

contoso
------Boundary--

### List documents
GET {{NovaKnowledge.Ingestion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingest/documents?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Get document status
GET {{NovaKnowledge.Ingestion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingest/documents/{{documentId}}/status
Accept: application/json

###
